                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f5eba441-dc7c-3fcb-af72-266ec4613afb",
                        "entry_id": "bc82a496-134f-386d-a025-5e43cc8b5183",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Person oder Erscheinung, die nicht an guter Laune interessiert ist beziehungsweise selbige verdirbt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7096f7b-d73e-481e-b22c-155d644a3fa5",
                                "sense_id": "f5eba441-dc7c-3fcb-af72-266ec4613afb",
                                "text": "„Politik muss sich nicht nur als Spaßbremse verstehen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5c432b7-3710-4303-ba63-ea8dcc787634",
                                "sense_id": "f5eba441-dc7c-3fcb-af72-266ec4613afb",
                                "text": "„Am Wochenende schlüpfte Frank Schmöller in zwei weitere Rollen: Er war am Samstag Spaßbremse und tags darauf Feierbiest.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1a9fb770-7484-477a-a359-2e8a296f3268",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc82a496-134f-386d-a025-5e43cc8b5183",
                        "source_sense_id": "f5eba441-dc7c-3fcb-af72-266ec4613afb",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person oder Erscheinung, die nicht an guter Laune interessiert ist beziehungsweise selbige verdirbt",
                        "target_lang_word": "killjoy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "killjoy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8a57dc4-90f0-3007-a89e-dde29d6c56e8",
                                        "entry_id": "d33d1f20-0fa7-315f-8387-275114cd0231",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is anti-fun, or prevents others from having fun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55b66a9a-1eba-46c8-9a2f-06f7ecc98a20",
                                                "sense_id": "e8a57dc4-90f0-3007-a89e-dde29d6c56e8",
                                                "text": "“If you mean me, sir, I call you and every one else to the inspection of my professional life. As to Christian or unchristian, I repudiate your canting palavering Christianity; and as to the way in which I spend my income, it is not my principle to maintain thieves and cheat offspring of their due inheritance in order to support religion and set myself up as a saintly Killjoy....”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae80950f-27cd-45dc-bc94-8c6295dee629",
                                                "sense_id": "e8a57dc4-90f0-3007-a89e-dde29d6c56e8",
                                                "text": "What kill-joy have we here? […] I feel it in my bones some rascal is come to Galing, one that bringeth ill hap in his pocket and a shadow athwart the sun on this our day of festival."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b566b090-a33e-4b64-b0ed-3a04b3637a46",
                                                "sense_id": "e8a57dc4-90f0-3007-a89e-dde29d6c56e8",
                                                "text": "He stalked behind her simple narrative, a kill-joy parent, hasty, intolerant, keeping a special cane to enforce the authority of his sadistic God[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91d332e1-af5d-4818-88eb-f10bc93d23f9",
                                                "sense_id": "e8a57dc4-90f0-3007-a89e-dde29d6c56e8",
                                                "text": "December 10 2005, Sam Murphy in The Guardian, A sober thought\nJust in time for the party season, some old killjoys at the journal Medicine & Science In Sports & Exercise have released their findings on the effects on muscle of prolonged heavy alcohol intake (six weeks is prolonged, apparently). The bad news is that it seems too much boozing puts all that effort in the gym to waste - in the study, alcohol prevented the usual resistance-training-induced muscle response that leads to increased size and strength."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ff7d1b1-f362-4ec6-9f8e-bc4b1da117cd",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc82a496-134f-386d-a025-5e43cc8b5183",
                        "source_sense_id": "f5eba441-dc7c-3fcb-af72-266ec4613afb",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person oder Erscheinung, die nicht an guter Laune interessiert ist beziehungsweise selbige verdirbt",
                        "target_lang_word": "spoilsport",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "spoilsport",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de36dbff-493f-3e61-a143-c36ff5620459",
                                        "entry_id": "e74eeec6-7fc9-35b4-8340-a3abf6ccc16e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who puts an end to others' fun, especially harmless fun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ff96a45-3c60-42c7-984e-76d918f931de",
                                                "sense_id": "de36dbff-493f-3e61-a143-c36ff5620459",
                                                "text": "I know I am a sad spoilsport, but it would make me wretched."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1bfd4711-224c-4fa2-9b43-b2d1fc5a3e78",
                                                "sense_id": "de36dbff-493f-3e61-a143-c36ff5620459",
                                                "text": "He looks a spoilsport. There are men in whose presence it is impossible to have any fun: men who are a sort of walking conscience."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "spoilsport",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79922354-9271-35ed-bc2f-f85f2d67a8c3",
                                        "entry_id": "8546e938-6784-36d5-9635-8fdabfb829f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Like a spoilsport."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ec26bf3-4914-435d-a907-5ceb71439328",
                                                "sense_id": "79922354-9271-35ed-bc2f-f85f2d67a8c3",
                                                "text": "It may seem somewhat spoilsport to focus in on this negative after another important victory but to ignore it would be delusion. Southgate will not be letting it escape his attention."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c41c5ac6-f8fd-4d6d-9b8f-eb6cfb23dbcc",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc82a496-134f-386d-a025-5e43cc8b5183",
                        "source_sense_id": "f5eba441-dc7c-3fcb-af72-266ec4613afb",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person oder Erscheinung, die nicht an guter Laune interessiert ist beziehungsweise selbige verdirbt",
                        "target_lang_word": "party pooper",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "party pooper",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f7a6528-608f-3d1a-8ae2-94f9f93aaf3d",
                                        "entry_id": "689c5cef-3492-332c-9612-137c305f725b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who dampens fun; especially, one who declines to participate in or enjoy a party or some other group activity; one who does not agree with the opinions of a group."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80d1e853-207d-4001-b448-b98eacc68754",
                                                "sense_id": "5f7a6528-608f-3d1a-8ae2-94f9f93aaf3d",
                                                "text": "Call me anti-social, call me a holiday-hater, call me Scrooge, call me a party-pooper—call me anything, but please don't call me about a party you're giving because I won't come."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa077cd9-f055-43c0-9668-bcb9f83e6d25",
                                                "sense_id": "5f7a6528-608f-3d1a-8ae2-94f9f93aaf3d",
                                                "text": "Still, it's not something that any country can easily walk away from—not even a Bush administration that has made a habit of being the party pooper in international forums."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ed538017-3072-46b0-bb91-7adb062b7ed9",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc82a496-134f-386d-a025-5e43cc8b5183",
                        "source_sense_id": "f5eba441-dc7c-3fcb-af72-266ec4613afb",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person oder Erscheinung, die nicht an guter Laune interessiert ist beziehungsweise selbige verdirbt",
                        "target_lang_word": "rabat-joie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rabat-joie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e145328-c737-3cb4-b8c9-a376e2ecde40",
                                        "entry_id": "75ecbd9a-a8a2-3d2b-9f87-cebf7b9a8c7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne triste ou ennemie de la joie des autres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c340ffa-6e5f-44be-af3a-032b412a341b",
                                                "sense_id": "1e145328-c737-3cb4-b8c9-a376e2ecde40",
                                                "text": "Ils en auraient vu de toutes les couleurs, tous ces rabat-joie à la mentalité étriquée ! Et toi, tu restes sans bouger, comme une jeune fille doit être ici pour pas faire parler d'elle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2d19f62-d691-4eff-8667-e0ca9797bb17",
                                                "sense_id": "1e145328-c737-3cb4-b8c9-a376e2ecde40",
                                                "text": "Simon a passé une heure sur ce toboggan, hier soir, en présence de son père. Il n'est pas tombé une seule fois. Alors cesse de jouer les rabat-joie et écoute ce que j'ai à te dire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "778eb9cf-8ab8-4ef6-a230-f64aa2b04b1a",
                                                "sense_id": "1e145328-c737-3cb4-b8c9-a376e2ecde40",
                                                "text": "Alice, dis-moi que tu ne vas pas épouser ce rabat-joie. Tu ne t’amuseras jamais avec un homme comme lui. Il ne te fera jamais rire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a07076f-bd4e-4a6e-b134-a8bfd8544169",
                                                "sense_id": "1e145328-c737-3cb4-b8c9-a376e2ecde40",
                                                "text": "Dans nos sociétés modernes, ne faudrait-il pas plus de rabat-joies pour prévenir l'agressivité invisible nichée dans la bonne humeur des “winners” ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01db6095-d208-4398-888f-76333a334bf7",
                                                "sense_id": "1e145328-c737-3cb4-b8c9-a376e2ecde40",
                                                "text": "— Et si on l’avait assassiné ? Réfléchis-y. Je sais ce que tu vas dire, mais non. Un crime est un crime, quelle que soit la victime.\n— Bon, d’accord… C’est pas pour faire le rabat-joie, mais admettons que ça soit le cas, t’obtiendras pas le Pulitzer pour ça, si ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a61b03c9-b5e2-31cf-a796-269a721f4bb0",
                                        "entry_id": "75ecbd9a-a8a2-3d2b-9f87-cebf7b9a8c7d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chose triste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9673b9ee-91e9-4721-a40e-f840edfaf53c",
                                                "sense_id": "a61b03c9-b5e2-31cf-a796-269a721f4bb0",
                                                "text": "Mais hélas ! ma très aimable bonne, vous dites bien vrai : pouvons-nous craindre un plus grand et un plus cruel rabat-joie que la douleur sensible de songer à se séparer presque aussitôt qu’on a commencé à sentir la joie de se revoir ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rabat-joie",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d90ec8f0-4fc0-3b51-bba1-80e04f5ee63b",
                                        "entry_id": "31cdafb7-9b79-31dd-a533-9e300d36c1e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui étouffe la joie des autres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb96b5e6-7c4a-41b3-8a53-0d0beba0c51a",
                                                "sense_id": "d90ec8f0-4fc0-3b51-bba1-80e04f5ee63b",
                                                "text": "[…] ; ici, ce sont ceux de la Hollande qui l'inspirent; toujours des enfants, mais l'enfance espiègle à présent, au lieu de l'enfance touchante, et, à la place du garde sauveur, la vieille bonne femme rabat-joie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c1e1805-0086-4177-903a-77692bae5c44",
                                                "sense_id": "d90ec8f0-4fc0-3b51-bba1-80e04f5ee63b",
                                                "text": "Ce message rabat-joie fut hué par une partie de la foule mais tempéra quelque peu l'enthousiasme général."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca986163-0f8d-4990-a3a4-2bc18938de00",
                                                "sense_id": "d90ec8f0-4fc0-3b51-bba1-80e04f5ee63b",
                                                "text": "Et sans doute avait-il encore moins envie de faire le moindre commentaire sur l’interminable litanie des propos rabat-joie que L’Ecclésiaste donne à entendre dans la Bible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
